        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've been good, You know you've been good. But for years the only thing you've had waiting under the tree is a lump of coal, black coal. You've had enough. You've tracked down this supposedly jolly man and his unsettling workshop. It's time to take back what is rightfully yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4195400/extras/1109f42a64555962f19d31c7619fd27f.poster.avif?t=1765540814\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=352 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4195400/extras/1109f42a64555962f19d31c7619fd27f.webm?t=1765540814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4195400/extras/1109f42a64555962f19d31c7619fd27f.mp4?t=1765540814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PSX-Era deign</strong>: Low poly models with the clunkyness to match</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Santa:</strong> A hunter that hulks over you, he patrols his workshop and will give chase if he sees you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth</strong>: You must hide and use blindspots to your advantage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jumpscares</strong>: Don't get caught or you are in for a fright</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now go get what you deserve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4195400/extras/09945a097f21b10d6d2a52ea9420c7a4.poster.avif?t=1765540814\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=172 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4195400/extras/09945a097f21b10d6d2a52ea9420c7a4.webm?t=1765540814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4195400/extras/09945a097f21b10d6d2a52ea9420c7a4.mp4?t=1765540814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've been good, You know you've been good. But for years the only thing you've had waiting under the tree is a lump of coal, black coal. You've had enough. You've tracked down this supposedly jolly man and his unsettling workshop. It's time to take back what is rightfully yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4195400/extras/1109f42a64555962f19d31c7619fd27f.poster.avif?t=1765540814\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=352 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4195400/extras/1109f42a64555962f19d31c7619fd27f.webm?t=1765540814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4195400/extras/1109f42a64555962f19d31c7619fd27f.mp4?t=1765540814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PSX-Era deign</strong>: Low poly models with the clunkyness to match</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Santa:</strong> A hunter that hulks over you, he patrols his workshop and will give chase if he sees you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth</strong>: You must hide and use blindspots to your advantage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jumpscares</strong>: Don't get caught or you are in for a fright</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now go get what you deserve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4195400/extras/09945a097f21b10d6d2a52ea9420c7a4.poster.avif?t=1765540814\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=172 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4195400/extras/09945a097f21b10d6d2a52ea9420c7a4.webm?t=1765540814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4195400/extras/09945a097f21b10d6d2a52ea9420c7a4.mp4?t=1765540814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
